      <h1>outside-ascii</h1>
      <p>A sentence with an em dash — a “curly quotation” and the name Zoë in it, none of which is ASCII</p>
      <p>The repository holds the shape of the plugin and none of what it is for. Nothing finished is published for it, so there is nothing to install and installing what is in the repository would add nothing a user can see. 4 prereleases are published, which is something to test rather than something to run.</p>
      <p>The plugin is built in the repository Fixture/jellyfin-plugin-outside-ascii, and what this page says about it is read from the roster rather than written here.</p>
      <nav aria-label="Where to go from here">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/Fixture/jellyfin-plugin-outside-ascii">The repository this plugin is built in</a></li>
          <li><a href="/">Every plugin and what state it is in</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      
    </main>
